0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 46 725 [
[(Here we use an exponential function as a waveshaping transfer)]
[(function. The theory is shown in detail in the accompanying)]
[(book, but in short, we adjust the sinusoid so that, as the)]
[(index increases, we scan starting from the left of the)]
[(transfer function \050previously the reading location grew from)]
[(the center\051. The table contains exp\050-x\051 with x varying from 0)]
[(to 10 When the index is zero, the output is the constant 1)]
[(and the spectrum holds only DC. As the index grows, the)]
[(output is a sequence of steadily narrower pulses, whose)]
[(spectrum gets progressively fatter and the DC component)]
[(decreases as you can see on the graphs.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 49 178 [
[(Table lookup is prepared as follows. First add one to the)]
[(sinusoid and adjust its amplitude according to index so it)]
[(ranges from 0 to 2*index. Then adjust for the table's input)]
[(scale \050100 points per unit, so multiply by 100\051 and add one)]
[(to skip the interpolation point at the beginning of the)]
[(table.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
